Chapter: Circumhorizontal Arc

Section: Preview Model

  ArcColour = record {
    ac-red : Integer,
    ac-green : Integer,
    ac-blue : Integer
  }

  ArcPreviewSettings = record {
    aps-elevation-degrees : Integer,
    aps-span-degrees : Integer,
    aps-band-degrees : Integer,
    aps-distance : Integer,
    aps-strength : Integer,
    aps-start-hour : Integer,
    aps-end-hour : Integer,
    aps-first-day : Integer,
    aps-period-days : Integer,
    aps-weathers : List Text,
    aps-spectrum : List ArcColour
  }

 A new world starts on Valheim day 1 (`EnvMan.GetDay`, measured 2026-09-23),
 so the arc shows on days 1, 8, 15 and so on. The weathers are
 `EnvSetup.m_name` values. Valheim has no dry, lightly clouded environment
 apart from these three: every environment with a thin rain-cloud layer also
 carries precipitation (LightRain, Snow, Twilight_Snow), and Mistlands_clear
 carries a full one (`m_rainCloudAlpha` 2), measured 2026-09-23.

  arc-preview-settings : ArcPreviewSettings = ArcPreviewSettings {
    aps-elevation-degrees = 12,
    aps-span-degrees = 70,
    aps-band-degrees = 16,
    aps-distance = 12000,
    aps-strength = 800,
    aps-start-hour = 9,
    aps-end-hour = 15,
    aps-first-day = 1,
    aps-period-days = 7,
    aps-weathers = ["Clear", "Heath clear", "Twilight_Clear"],
    aps-spectrum = [
      ArcColour { ac-red = 600, ac-green = 120, ac-blue = 1000 },
      ArcColour { ac-red = 120, ac-green = 300, ac-blue = 1000 },
      ArcColour { ac-red = 0, ac-green = 800, ac-blue = 1000 },
      ArcColour { ac-red = 150, ac-green = 1000, ac-blue = 350 },
      ArcColour { ac-red = 1000, ac-green = 950, ac-blue = 120 },
      ArcColour { ac-red = 1000, ac-green = 450, ac-blue = 40 },
      ArcColour { ac-red = 1000, ac-green = 100, ac-blue = 30 }
    ]
  }
